        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Collaborations 3, Collaborations albums\n- People: Sukshinder Shinda, Jazzy B, Diljit Dosanjh, Kamal Khan, Shazia Manzoor, Surinder Shinda, Richa Sharma, Abrar-Ul-Haq, Don Revo\n- Topics: Indian film playback singing, devotional singing, Bollywood music\n- Works: Baabul\n\nFacts:\n- Richa Sharma was born on 29 August 1980.\n- Richa Sharma is an Indian film playback singer and devotional singer.\n- In 2006, Richa Sharma sang Bollywood's longest track, the bidaai song, in the film Baabul.\n- Collaborations 3 is an album in Sukshinder Shinda's Collaborations album series.\n- Collaborations 3 features Jazzy B, Diljit Dosanjh, Kamal Khan, Shazia Manzoor, Surinder Shinda, Richa Sharma, Abrar-Ul-Haq, and Don Revo.",
